---
title: "Pair and manage a Nowhere remote signer"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Saved signer settings cannot be read
  s1: No saved signer
  s2: Signer settings saved
  s3: Waiting for the bunker
  s4: Waiting for a signer to pair
  s5: Reading the signer's public key
  s6: Pairing failed
  s7: Saving signer settings
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  [*] --> s2
  s0 --> s3: connect with a bunker
  s0 --> s4: wait on a pairing URI
  s1 --> s3: connect with a bunker
  s1 --> s4: wait on a pairing URI
  s2 --> s1: forget saved signer
  s2 --> s3: connect with a bunker
  s2 --> s4: wait on a pairing URI
  s3 --> s5: signer authorizes the connection
  s3 --> s6: report a pairing or save error
  s4 --> s5: signer authorizes the connection
  s4 --> s6: report a pairing or save error
  s5 --> s6: report a pairing or save error
  s5 --> s7: receive the public key
  s6 --> s3: connect with a bunker
  s6 --> s4: wait on a pairing URI
  s6 --> s0: check saved signer settings
  s6 --> s1: forget saved signer or check saved signer settings
  s6 --> s2: check saved signer settings
  s7 --> s2: save the signer locally
  s7 --> s6: report a pairing or save error
